You receive some messages from them {"2": [{"message_id": 1, "content": "Hello! I'm interested in learning more about your cleaning services. Could you please provide details on the packages you offer, including pricing and frequency options?", "sender_id": 12, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:09:42.396455"}, {"message_id": 2, "content": "Hello, I'm interested in learning more about your cleaning services. Could you please provide me with a detailed list of services offered and your pricing structure?", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:09:48.898115"}, {"message_id": 3, "content": "Hi, I'm the office manager from [Company Name]. We're looking for a cleaning service and I saw your company provides this. Could you send me more information about your services, including pricing and availability?", "sender_id": 13, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:09:54.964715"}, {"message_id": 5, "content": "Hello, I'm interested in learning more about your cleaning services for our office. Could you please provide details on the packages you offer, including frequency options and pricing? We are looking for a comprehensive cleaning solution for a medium-sized office space.", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:16.315295"}, {"message_id": 8, "content": "Hello, I'm the office manager for a medium-sized company looking to hire a professional cleaning service. We're interested in discussing your services further. Could you please provide more information on your offerings, pricing, and availability?", "sender_id": 8, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:11:03.520055"}, {"message_id": 9, "content": "Hello room_eco_shine_rep_1, I am interested in your cleaning services for my office. Could you please provide me with more details about your service packages, pricing, and availability? I am looking for a comprehensive cleaning solution and would like to discuss potential terms.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:11:17.881535"}, {"message_id": 13, "content": "Thank you for your interest! To help us tailor a quote, could you please specify the approximate square footage of your office space and your preferred cleaning frequency (e.g., daily, weekly, bi-weekly)? This will allow us to provide more accurate information on our packages and pricing.", "sender_id": 8, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:13:38.226575"}, {"message_id": 14, "content": "Thank you for your response. To help us tailor a quote, could you please specify what is included in your standard cleaning package? We are particularly interested in services like carpet cleaning, window washing, and common area sanitization. Additionally, what are your typical contract lengths and payment terms?", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:13:45.857735"}, {"message_id": 16, "content": "Hello, I'm the office manager for a medium-sized company looking to hire a professional cleaning service. We're interested in discussing your services further. Could you please provide more information on your offerings, pricing, and availability? We are looking for a comprehensive cleaning solution and would like to discuss potential terms.", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:14:11.873615"}, {"message_id": 17, "content": "Hello! Thank you for your interest in our cleaning services. We offer several packages designed for medium-sized offices, all emphasizing eco-friendly practices. Our services include general office cleaning, deep cleaning, restroom sanitization, and common area maintenance. We offer flexible scheduling, with options for daily, weekly, bi-weekly, or monthly services. For a detailed quote tailored to your specific needs, please let me know your office size and any particular requirements you may have. We're eager to offer you a sparkling clean and healthy work environment.", "sender_id": 7, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:14:33.238235"}]}
