You receive some messages from them {"4": [{"message_id": 2, "content": "Hello Sarah, I'm a freelance web developer who specializes in e-commerce websites. I understand you're looking for someone to build a new online store. I'd love to learn more about your project, your vision, and your budget. Are you available for a brief chat sometime this week?", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:36.390687"}, {"message_id": 4, "content": "Hi Sarah, it was great speaking with you earlier! I'm excited about the possibility of working with you on your new e-commerce website. I've put together a proposal based on our conversation that I think offers excellent value. It includes a custom-designed, mobile-responsive website with full e-commerce functionality, including product management, secure checkout, and payment gateway integration. My rate is $100/hour, and I estimate this project will take between 60-80 hours, putting the total project cost between $6,000 and $8,000. I'm confident I can deliver a beautiful and functional website within your 6-week timeline. How does this sound to you?", "sender_id": 7, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:46.675587"}]}
