You receive some messages from them {"1": [{"message_id": 4, "content": "Hello, I am interested in learning more about your cleaning services.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:09:55.036595"}, {"message_id": 6, "content": "Hello Sparkle Clean representatives, I'm interested in discussing a cleaning service contract for our office. Please let me know your availability for a meeting next week.", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:17.225495"}, {"message_id": 7, "content": "Hello, I am interested in your cleaning services for our office. Could you please provide more details about the specific services included in your standard package and your pricing structure?", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:22.687055"}, {"message_id": 10, "content": "Hello, thank you for your interest in Sparkle Clean. We'd be happy to discuss our services further. We can provide details on our standard package and pricing, as well as discuss a custom contract for your office needs. Please let us know what time works best for you next week for a meeting.", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:13:25.224335"}, {"message_id": 11, "content": "Hello, thank you for your interest. To provide you with the most accurate information, could you please specify the size of your office space and the types of services you are most interested in? This will help us tailor our response and pricing.", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:13:36.183755"}, {"message_id": 12, "content": "Hello! Thank you for your interest in Sparkle Clean. We offer a comprehensive cleaning package that includes dusting, vacuuming, mopping, sanitizing restrooms, and emptying trash bins. We also offer specialized services like deep cleaning, carpet cleaning, and window washing. We pride ourselves on our reliability and attention to detail. I'd be happy to provide a detailed quote and discuss your specific needs. Would you be available for a brief call next week to go over the specifics?", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:13:37.013495"}, {"message_id": 15, "content": "Hello, thank you for your interest in our cleaning services. I would like to schedule a meeting next week to discuss your needs in detail and provide you with information about our packages and pricing. Please let me know what time works best for you.", "sender_id": 1, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:13:57.937415"}, {"message_id": 18, "content": "Hello! Thank you for your interest in Sparkle Clean. We'd be happy to provide you with more details about our standard cleaning package and pricing structure. To best tailor our offerings, could you please share the approximate size of your office space and your preferred cleaning frequency? We will follow up with a detailed proposal shortly. Alternatively, we can schedule a brief call to discuss your specific needs. Please let us know what works best for you.", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:14:33.654635"}, {"message_id": 21, "content": "Thank you all for your interest in Sparkle Clean! To help us provide you with the most accurate information and a tailored quote, please let us know the approximate size of your office space and your preferred cleaning frequency. We offer a comprehensive standard package including dusting, vacuuming, mopping, restroom sanitization, and trash removal. Specialized services like deep cleaning, carpet, and window cleaning are also available. We are available for meetings next week to discuss your specific needs. Please let us know what time works best for you.", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:16:32.352815"}, {"message_id": 22, "content": "To provide you with the most accurate quote, our office is approximately 5000 sq ft. We are interested in a nightly cleaning service, with the exception of weekends and holidays. We'd also be interested in deep cleaning services quarterly. Please let us know your availability for a meeting next week to discuss this further.", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:16:35.681375"}, {"message_id": 23, "content": "Hello Sparkle Clean representatives, I'm interested in discussing a cleaning service contract for our office. Please let me know your availability for a meeting next week and provide details on your standard package and pricing structure.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:16:37.617875"}, {"message_id": 24, "content": "Hello, thank you for your interest in our cleaning services. To help us provide you with the most accurate and tailored proposal, could you please provide the following details:\n1. The approximate square footage of your office space.\n2. Your preferred cleaning frequency (e.g., daily, weekly, bi-weekly).\n3. Any specific areas or services that are of particular importance to you (e.g., deep cleaning, window washing, specific high-traffic areas).\n4. Your budget range, if you are comfortable sharing.\n\nOnce we have this information, we can provide you with a detailed breakdown of our services and a customized quote. We look forward to the possibility of working with you.", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:16:53.141375"}, {"message_id": 25, "content": "Hello Sparkle Clean representatives, thank you for your responses. To help me evaluate your services, could you please provide more specific details on your standard cleaning package, including pricing and frequency options? Also, please let me know about any specialized services you offer.", "sender_id": 1, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:17:03.269195"}, {"message_id": 26, "content": "Hello Sparkle Clean representatives, thank you for your detailed responses. Our office space is approximately 5000 sq ft, and we are looking for cleaning services twice a week. We are interested in a comprehensive package that includes dusting, vacuuming, mopping, restroom sanitization, and trash removal. We would also be interested in discussing your deep cleaning services for a potential quarterly add-on. Please let us know your pricing for this frequency and scope of services. We are available for a call next week to discuss further.", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:17:06.522815"}, {"message_id": 28, "content": "To sender ID 4: Could you please provide detailed information about the specific services included in your standard cleaning package and your pricing structure?", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:17:25.773275"}]}
