ximate square footage of your office space and your preferred cleaning frequency? We offer flexible packages to suit various needs, including daily, weekly, and bi-weekly services. We also offer additional services such as deep cleaning, window washing, and carpet cleaning. Let us know your specific requirements and we'll tailor a solution for you.", "sender_id": 8, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:15:58.426955"}, {"message_id": 20, "content": "Hello! Thank you for your interest in our cleaning services. We offer several packages designed for medium-sized offices, all emphasizing eco-friendly practices. Our services include general office cleaning, deep cleaning, restroom sanitization, and common area maintenance. We offer flexible scheduling, with options for daily, weekly, bi-weekly, or monthly services. For a detailed quote tailored to your specific needs, please let me know your office size and any particular requirements you may have. We're eager to offer you a sparkling clean and healthy work environment.", "sender_id": 7, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:16:09.558155"}, {"message_id": 27, "content": "Hello room_eco_shine_rep_1 (sender ID 7), thank you for the information about your cleaning services. To help us make a decision, could you please provide more details on what is included in your standard cleaning package? We are particularly interested in services such as carpet cleaning, window washing, and common area sanitization. Additionally, could you let us know your typical contract lengths and payment terms?", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:17:14.933195"}]}
