You receive some messages from them {"4": [{"message_id": 2, "content": "Hi team, I understand there's some confusion regarding task responsibilities. Let's have a brief chat to clarify ownership and ensure we're all aligned. Liam, could you please outline your understanding of the tasks and why you feel they fall under your colleague's role? We want to make sure everyone feels their contributions are valued and that the workload is distributed fairly.", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:54.360094"}, {"message_id": 4, "content": "Hello team, I understand there's a disagreement regarding task responsibilities. My goal is to help us clarify these and ensure we can move forward collaboratively. Could each of you share your perspective on the tasks in question? Let's aim to find a solution that works for everyone and keeps our project on track.", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:59.756314"}, {"message_id": 15, "content": "Liam, could you please share your perspective on these tasks and why you believe they belong to your colleague? Understanding your viewpoint is key to resolving this.", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:17:32.410534"}, {"message_id": 16, "content": "Hi team, I understand there's a disagreement regarding task responsibilities. My goal is to help us clarify these and ensure we can move forward collaboratively. Could each of you share your perspective on the tasks in question? Let's aim to find a solution that works for everyone and keeps our project on track.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:17:38.252614"}, {"message_id": 21, "content": "Thank you for bringing this forward, sender 10. Liam, your input is valuable here. Could you please elaborate on your understanding of these tasks and your reasoning for them being assigned to your colleague? Once you've shared your perspective, we'll hear from your colleague to ensure we have a comprehensive view.", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:22:48.913294"}]}
