You receive some messages from them {"6": [{"message_id": 4, "content": "Hi Mark, I'm ready to discuss a settlement for the damages and lost wages from the recent accident. Please let me know when you are available to talk.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:29.260231"}, {"message_id": 7, "content": "I have attached the repair estimates and documentation for my lost wages. Please review them and let me know your thoughts.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:12:43.862971"}, {"message_id": 11, "content": "Hi Mark, thank you for reaching out. I am also ready to discuss a settlement. Please let me know your availability for a call this week to go over the details. I will have all the necessary documentation regarding repairs and lost wages ready.", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:13:39.960511"}, {"message_id": 19, "content": "Thank you for your prompt response. I've reviewed the estimates and documentation you provided. While I understand these are yourR assessment, they appear to be higher than our standard repair costs for similar damages. We typically offer settlements based on average repair expenses and the depreciated value of the vehicle. I can offer a settlement of $1,500 for the repairs and $300 for lost wages, totaling $1,800. Please let me know if this is acceptable.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:19:35.022811"}, {"message_id": 22, "content": "Thank you for sending over the repair estimates and lost wage documentation. I will review them shortly. I am still available for a call this week to discuss these details further. Please let me know what time works best for you.", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:22:41.754571"}]}
