You receive some messages from them {"3": [{"message_id": 3, "content": "Hi Mr. Jones, I hope this message finds you well. I'm writing to discuss the upcoming lease renewal for my bookstore. As my lease is set to expire in three months, I'd like to explore the possibility of renewing it. I've greatly valued my tenancy at this location for the past five years and have always strived to be a responsible and timely tenant. I'm keen to continue operating my business here and would appreciate the opportunity to discuss the terms of a new lease agreement with you at your earliest convenience. Please let me know what time works best for you.", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:55.882968"}, {"message_id": 4, "content": "Dear Mr. Jones,\n\nI hope this message finds you well.\n\nAs you know, my current lease for the bookstore is expiring in three months. I've greatly valued operating my business at this location for the past five years and would very much like to renew the lease.\n\nI'm writing to propose a renewal of my lease. I've been a reliable tenant, consistently paying rent on time and taking good care of the property, and I hope to continue that for the foreseeable future.\n\nRegarding the terms, I would be very grateful if we could renew the lease at the current rental rate. I am open to discussing a longer lease term, perhaps for another five years, in exchange for maintaining the current rent.\n\nPlease let me know your thoughts on this. I'm available to discuss this further at your convenience.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name]", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:11:19.858008"}, {"message_id": 13, "content": "Dear Mr. Jones,\n\nThank you for your messages. I appreciate you sending over the lease renewal proposal, and I am particularly encouraged by the possibility of a five-year term at the current rental rate. As a long-term tenant who values this location, I am eager to find terms that are mutually beneficial and sustainable.\n\nI am available to meet at your convenience to discuss this further and explore how we can formalize this agreement. Please let me know your availability.\n\nSincerely,", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:17:19.020408"}, {"message_id": 20, "content": "Dear Mr. Jones,\n\nI hope you're having a good week. I'm just following up on my previous message regarding the lease renewal. I'm still very interested in discussing the terms and finding a mutually agreeable solution. Please let me know if you have had a chance to consider my proposal and if there's a specific time that works for you to connect.\n\nThank you.", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:24:51.280668"}]}
