You receive some messages from them {"4": [{"message_id": 7, "content": "Dear Mr. Jones,\n\nI hope this message finds you well.\n\nAs you know, my current lease for the bookstore will be expiring in three months. I've greatly valued operating my business at this location for the past five years and would be very interested in renewing the lease.\n\nI've always prioritized being a responsible and timely tenant, and I hope my tenancy has been a positive one for you as well. I'd like to discuss the terms for a new lease, and I'm open to discussing a longer lease duration if that's something you'd consider.\n\nPlease let me know when might be a good time for us to talk.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name/Bookstore Name]", "sender_id": 7, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:12:20.788128"}, {"message_id": 11, "content": "Dear [Your Name/Bookstore Name],\n\nThank you for reaching out and for your message. I appreciate you bringing up the lease renewal well in advance. I agree that your tenancy has been a positive one, and I'm certainly open to discussing a renewal.\n\nI'd be happy to meet and discuss the terms. How about we schedule a brief meeting for next week? Please let me know what day and time works best for you.\n\nBest regards,\nMr. Jones", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:14:34.370568"}, {"message_id": 16, "content": "Dear Mr. Jones,\n\nThank you for your prompt response and for being open to discussing the lease renewal. I appreciate that.\n\nI'm available to meet next week on Tuesday at 10 AM or Thursday at 2 PM. Please let me know if either of those times work for you. If not, I'm happy to find another time that suits your schedule.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name/Bookstore Name]", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:23:14.278008"}, {"message_id": 19, "content": "Dear Mr. Jones,\n\nThank you for your prompt response and for being open to discussing the lease renewal.\n\nI'm available to meet next week. Would Tuesday afternoon or Wednesday morning work for you? Please let me know if either of those times are convenient, or suggest another time that suits you better.\n\nI look forward to our conversation.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name/Bookstore Name]", "sender_id": 7, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:23:51.384408"}]}
