You receive some messages from them {"5": [{"message_id": 5, "content": "Dear Mr. Jones, I hope this message finds you well. I'm writing to discuss the upcoming lease renewal for the bookstore. I've truly valued our relationship over the past five years and am eager to continue operating here. I'd like to propose a renewal of the lease and am open to discussing terms that are mutually beneficial. Please let me know when would be a good time to connect and talk further.", "sender_id": 8, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:11:32.533968"}, {"message_id": 8, "content": "Dear Mr. Jones, Thank you for your message. I'm also very keen to renew the lease and continue our positive relationship. I've been a reliable tenant for five years, and I hope we can reach an agreement that reflects this. I'd like to propose a renewal for a longer term, perhaps three to five years, with a commitment to maintaining the property meticulously. Would you be open to discussing a renewal at the current rental rate, or perhaps a very modest increase that we can agree on? I'm available to chat at your earliest convenience. Best regards,", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:14:08.743548"}, {"message_id": 22, "content": "Dear Mr. Jones, Thank you for your prompt and positive response. I'm very pleased to hear you're keen to renew the lease and continue our relationship. A longer-term lease of three to five years sounds like an excellent idea, and I am fully committed to maintaining the property to the highest standards. Regarding the rent, I would be delighted if we could agree to a renewal at the current rental rate. As you know, I have been a consistent and reliable tenant for five years, always paying rent on time and contributing positively to the community. I believe renewing at the current rate would be a mutually beneficial arrangement, solidifying a long-term partnership. I am available to discuss this further at your convenience. Please let me know what time works best for you to connect.", "sender_id": 8, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:27:21.861408"}]}
