You receive some messages from them {"6": [{"message_id": 1, "content": "Hi Mr. Jones, I hope this message finds you well. I'm writing to discuss renewing my lease for the bookstore. My current lease is set to expire in three months, and I'd like to explore the possibility of a renewal. I've enjoyed being a tenant for the past five years and have always prioritized maintaining the property and paying rent on time. I'm hoping we can come to an agreement that's mutually beneficial. Please let me know when might be a good time to talk further.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:43.501788"}, {"message_id": 10, "content": "Dear Mr. Jones,\n\nThank you for your message. I appreciate you reaching out regarding the lease renewal for the bookstore. I'm also very keen to discuss this with you.\n\nAs you know, I've been a tenant for five years, and I've always valued our relationship and have made it a priority to maintain the property and ensure rent is paid promptly. I'm invested in the success of the bookstore and would like to continue operating from this location.\n\nI'm hoping we can discuss terms that are fair and allow the business to continue to thrive. I'm available to talk at your earliest convenience. Please let me know what time works best for you.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name/Bookstore Name]", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:14:32.156988"}, {"message_id": 14, "content": "Following up on my previous message regarding the lease renewal. I'm still keen to find a time to discuss this. Perhaps we could schedule a brief call sometime next week? Please let me know what works for you.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:21:14.091828"}, {"message_id": 15, "content": "Hi Mr. Jones, to follow up on our discussion about the lease renewal, would you be available for a quick chat this coming Tuesday at 10 AM? I'm eager to discuss the terms and ensure we can reach an agreement.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:23:14.260548"}, {"message_id": 23, "content": "Dear Mr. Jones,\n\nThank you for following up. I appreciate you suggesting a call next week to discuss the lease renewal.\n\nI am available on Tuesday, April 1st, at 2:00 PM, or on Thursday, April 3rd, at 10:00 AM. Please let me know if either of those times work for you, or if there's another time that might be more convenient.\n\nI look forward to our conversation.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name/Bookstore Name]", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:27:45.654768"}]}
