You receive some messages from them {"6": [{"message_id": 2, "content": "Hi Jane, I'm interested in the car you're selling for $12,000. I've looked it over and it seems to be in good condition. I'd like to make a serious offer of $10,500. Would you be open to discussing this further?", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:09:36.571588"}, {"message_id": 10, "content": "Hello Jane, thank you for listing the car. I've had a chance to inspect it and I'm very interested. Based on its condition and current market value, I'd like to make an offer of $10,800. I'm confident we can reach a fair agreement.", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:11:08.719108"}, {"message_id": 16, "content": "Hi Jane, thanks for considering my offer. I understand you've received another offer. I'm still very interested in your car and would like to increase my offer to $11,300. I believe this is a fair price reflecting its condition and shows my serious interest in purchasing it.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:16:14.119168"}, {"message_id": 17, "content": "Jane, I see there's another offer at $10,500. To ensure I secure the car, I'm prepared to match that offer. Please let me know if you'd like to proceed.", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:17:26.173828"}, {"message_id": 20, "content": "Jane, I understand the offers are escalating. To demonstrate my strong interest and to meet you closer to your asking price, I can increase my offer to $11,100. I believe this is a very competitive offer that reflects the car's value.", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:22:22.932328"}, {"message_id": 27, "content": "Hi Jane, just following up on my offer of $11,300. As it's the highest offer on the table and within a reasonable negotiation range of your asking price, I'm hopeful we can finalize the sale soon. Please let me know your thoughts.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:26:58.297048"}]}
