You receive some messages from them {"2": [{"message_id": 4, "content": "Hi Mike, I'm looking to place a large order for [Ingredient Name]. The standard price is $5/kg, but given the volume, I'm hoping we can discuss a more favorable rate. What kind of discount can you offer for an order of [Quantity]kg?", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:31.547068"}, {"message_id": 9, "content": "Hi Mike, I'm looking to place a large order for our upcoming production run. The standard price is $5/kg, but given the volume, I'm hoping we can negotiate a more favorable rate. Can we discuss potential volume discounts?", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:53.905528"}, {"message_id": 13, "content": "Thanks for reaching out. For a large order, I can offer a 5% discount off the standard $5/kg price, bringing it to $4.75/kg. Let me know if this works for your volume.", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:13:06.220528"}, {"message_id": 18, "content": "$4.75/kg is a bit higher than I was hoping for. Given the order size, I was expecting something closer to $4.50/kg. Can you do any better?", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:19:57.385648"}, {"message_id": 26, "content": "Thanks for the offer, Mike. While a 5% discount is a good start, for an order of this magnitude, we were hoping for something closer to a 10% discount. Would $4.50/kg be feasible? We're keen to establish a strong, long-term partnership.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:22:56.518408"}]}
