You receive some messages from them {"3": [{"message_id": 1, "content": "Hello Mike, I'm interested in discussing a bulk order for our upcoming production run. I'd like to explore pricing options for a significant quantity of your product. Could you let me know your availability for a brief call this week?", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:20.347768"}, {"message_id": 2, "content": "Hi Mike, I'd like to discuss a potential large order for our upcoming production run. The standard price is $5/kg, but given the volume, I'm hoping we can negotiate a better rate.", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:25.704448"}, {"message_id": 11, "content": "I appreciate you reaching out. I'm looking to order approximately 10,000 kg. What kind of discount could you offer for an order of this size?", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:12:23.373628"}, {"message_id": 14, "content": "Thank you for your interest in a bulk order. I understand you're looking for a favorable price given the volume. The standard rate is indeed $5/kg. To provide you with the most accurate and competitive pricing, could you please share more details about the quantity you anticipate needing, as well as the specific product and any desired delivery timelines? This will help me assess the best possible options for you. I'm available for a call to discuss this further at your convenience.", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:14:18.830548"}, {"message_id": 20, "content": "As previously mentioned, I'm looking to order approximately 10,000 kg. Regarding delivery, we'd need it within the next 4-6 weeks. Could you provide a quote based on this volume and timeline?", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:20:05.559028"}, {"message_id": 24, "content": "Thank you for providing the quantity details. For an order of 10,000 kg, we can offer the following pricing structure:\n\n1.  A 5% discount, bringing the price to $4.75/kg, if the order is confirmed and placed within the next two weeks.\n2.  A 7% discount, bringing the price to $4.65/kg, for immediate delivery and payment.\n\nWe are also open to discussing further price adjustments if you are considering a longer-term supply agreement with us. Please let me know how you would like to proceed or if you'd like to schedule a call to discuss these options in more detail.", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:20:47.805088"}]}
