You receive some messages from them {"4": [{"message_id": 3, "content": "Hello Mike, I'm interested in discussing a potential bulk order for our upcoming production run. Can we schedule a time to talk about pricing?", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:25.951708"}, {"message_id": 5, "content": "Hi Mike, I'm looking to place a large order for ingredient X. The standard price is $5/kg, but given the volume, I'm hoping we can negotiate a better rate. What kind of discount can you offer for an order of 10,000 kg?", "sender_id": 7, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:34.889908"}, {"message_id": 15, "content": "Hello Agent 7, thank you for reaching out regarding the bulk order. We appreciate your business and understand your need for favorable pricing on a 10,000 kg order. While our standard price is $5/kg, for this significant volume, we can offer a price of $4.50/kg. This reflects our commitment to providing value for our partners on large-scale commitments. Please let me know your thoughts.", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:15:05.199208"}, {"message_id": 22, "content": "Thank you for the offer of $4.50/kg. I need to review this internally and will get back to you with a counter-proposal shortly.", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:20:18.812188"}, {"message_id": 27, "content": "Thanks for the $4.50/kg offer, Mike. What are your payment terms for this volume? Perhaps we can optimize the overall deal.", "sender_id": 7, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:27:04.981408"}]}
