You receive some messages from them {"5": [{"message_id": 3, "content": "Hi Jane, I'm interested in your car. The listed price is $12,000. I've had a look and it seems to be in good condition. Would you consider $10,500?", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:09:37.559968"}, {"message_id": 14, "content": "Hi Jane, thanks for considering my offer. I understand you've taken good care of the car. How about $11,000? I'm keen to finalize the purchase soon.", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:14:14.130208"}, {"message_id": 15, "content": "Thanks for your offer! I appreciate you taking the time to inspect the car. $10,500 is a bit lower than I was hoping to get, especially considering the car's excellent condition and recent maintenance. Would you be able to come up a little? I'd be willing to consider something closer to $11,500.", "sender_id": 8, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:14:41.118088"}, {"message_id": 21, "content": "Hi Jane, I understand. $11,500 is a bit higher than I was initially hoping, but I do want the car. How about we meet in the middle at $11,250? I'm ready to make the purchase at that price.", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:22:22.949248"}, {"message_id": 23, "content": "That's a fair offer, and I appreciate you meeting me halfway. How about we settle on $11,250? I think that's a great deal for both of us and allows us to finalize the purchase today.", "sender_id": 8, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:23:16.120168"}]}
