You receive some messages from them {"1": [{"message_id": 6, "content": "Hello Sarah, I hope you're having a productive week. I've been thinking about our initial conversation regarding the e-commerce website, and I'd like to propose a refined scope of work and discuss pricing.\n\nBased on your business needs, I recommend a comprehensive solution that includes:\n\n-   **Custom E-commerce Platform Development:** A fully responsive and scalable online store tailored to your brand, with secure payment gateway integration, inventory management, and order processing capabilities.\n-   **Content Management System (CMS):** An intuitive backend for you to easily manage products, updates, and content.\n-   **Basic On-Page SEO Setup:** Ensuring your site is optimized for search engines from the start.\n-   **User Account Functionality:** Allowing customers to register, track orders, and manage their information.\n-   **Post-Launch Support:** 30 days of support for any issues or minor adjustments.\n\nFor this scope, my rate is $100 per hour. I estimate this project will require approximately 80-100 hours of work, bringing the total estimated cost to $8,000 - $10,000. I'm confident this investment will provide a strong foundation for your online business growth.\n\nI'm flexible and happy to discuss any adjustments to the scope or payment terms to align with your budget and expectations. Please let me know your thoughts.", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:11:15.702627"}]}
