You receive some messages from them {"2": [{"message_id": 2, "content": "I would like to discuss my current compensation. I have consistently exceeded expectations in my role over the past year, taken on additional responsibilities, and made significant contributions to our team's success. I believe my current salary does not reflect my performance or market value, and I would like to request a salary increase. I am confident that my contributions justify this adjustment, and I am eager to discuss this further with you.", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:09:57.945315"}, {"message_id": 8, "content": "Hi David, I'd appreciate the opportunity to discuss my recent performance and contributions over the past year. I'm keen to understand your perspective and explore how my role and compensation align with my responsibilities and achievements. Would you be open to scheduling a brief meeting to chat about this?", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:56.689335"}, {"message_id": 15, "content": "That's great to hear, David. I'm also very keen to discuss this further. Please let me know what time works best for you to schedule a meeting.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:19:41.115375"}, {"message_id": 18, "content": "I'm glad to hear that, David. I'm available to meet at your earliest convenience. Please let me know what time works best for you. Looking forward to discussing how we can ensure my compensation accurately reflects my value and contributions to the team.", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:21:22.551135"}, {"message_id": 24, "content": "Thank you for being open to this discussion, David. I'm available to meet on Tuesday afternoon or anytime on Wednesday. Please let me know if any of those times work for you, or if another time would be more convenient. I look forward to discussing my contributions and compensation.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:26:43.868055"}]}
