panies!", "sender_id": 1, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:23:04.596783"}, {"message_id": 23, "content": "Hi Alex, I'm available for a call on Wednesday at 10 AM PST or Thursday at 2 PM PST. Please let me know which of these times works best for you, or if another time would be more convenient. I'm looking forward to our discussion!", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:24:15.131463"}]}
