You receive some messages from them {"4": [{"message_id": 2, "content": "Hello Alex, I'm looking to discuss a potential partnership to integrate your innovative feature into our platform. I'm confident we can create a mutually beneficial agreement. What are your thoughts on a revenue-sharing model and initial integration terms?", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:22.404003"}, {"message_id": 7, "content": "Hi Alex, I'm very impressed with your team's innovative feature and see great potential for it on our platform. We believe integrating it would be a win-win, offering your feature significant exposure to our large user base. I'd like to discuss a partnership and propose a revenue share of 25% for your team, along with prominent attribution. Let me know your thoughts.", "sender_id": 7, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:11:45.728283"}, {"message_id": 11, "content": "Hi Alex, thank you for your prompt response and the offer. We appreciate the 25% revenue share and the proposed attribution. Given the significant reach and integration capabilities our platform offers, we believe a 30% revenue share would be a more equitable starting point, reflecting the value and growth we can drive for your feature. We are eager to finalize a partnership that maximizes benefits for both our companies.", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:14:37.938963"}, {"message_id": 24, "content": "Hi Alex, regarding the revenue share, we've proposed 30%. We're open to discussing a compromise, perhaps a tiered structure or exploring other ways we can add value beyond the revenue split, such as co-marketing opportunities. What are your thoughts on exploring these options?", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:27:50.198763"}]}
