You receive some messages from them {"2": [{"message_id": 3, "content": "Hi Sarah, I'm excited about the possibility of working on your new e-commerce website. To start, could you share more details about your budget expectations and the key features you envision for the site? This will help me tailor a proposal that aligns with your needs and provides the best value.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:39.751707"}, {"message_id": 10, "content": "Hi Sarah, it was great discussing your new e-commerce website. Based on our conversation, I've put together a proposal that I believe offers excellent value within your budget of $8,000 and a 6-week timeline. My plan includes a custom, mobile-responsive design, setup for up to 15 products, a secure shopping cart and checkout, payment gateway integration, basic SEO, and contact/social media integration. For payment, I propose a 50% deposit upfront, 25% upon design approval, and the remaining 25% upon website launch. I'm confident I can deliver a beautiful and functional site that will help grow your business. What are your thoughts on this plan?", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:12:09.707547"}, {"message_id": 16, "content": "Hi Sarah, I see you've received a proposal. I'm keen to hear your thoughts on it and how it aligns with your vision. I'm confident we can work together to create an exceptional e-commerce website that meets your specific needs and budget. Let me know if you'd like to discuss this further or explore other options.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:23:30.806367"}]}
