INFO:social.agent:Agent 4 observing environment: And there are many group chat channels {"1": "agent_f3427e6943a2_x_business_owner_sarah", "2": "agent_33cc369af8da_x_business_owner_sarah", "3": "agent_84b6dab51c92_x_business_owner_sarah", "4": "agent_5afe5dbeb16a_x_business_owner_sarah", "5": "agent_0143336fb329_x_business_owner_sarah", "6": "agent_545a19f3e6df_x_business_owner_sarah"}
