You receive some messages from them {"4": [{"message_id": 2, "content": "Hello Sarah, I'm a freelance web developer who specializes in e-commerce websites. I understand you're looking for someone to build a new online store. I'd love to learn more about your project, your vision, and your budget. Are you available for a brief chat sometime this week?", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:36.390687"}, {"message_id": 4, "content": "Hi Sarah, it was great speaking with you earlier! I'm excited about the possibility of working with you on your new e-commerce website. I've put together a proposal based on our conversation that I think offers excellent value. It includes a custom-designed, mobile-responsive website with full e-commerce functionality, including product management, secure checkout, and payment gateway integration. My rate is $100/hour, and I estimate this project will take between 60-80 hours, putting the total project cost between $6,000 and $8,000. I'm confident I can deliver a beautiful and functional website within your 6-week timeline. How does this sound to you?", "sender_id": 7, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:46.675587"}, {"message_id": 18, "content": "Hi Sarah, I wanted to follow up on my proposal. I understand that budget is a key consideration, and I want to assure you that I'm committed to delivering a high-quality website that meets your needs within your $8,000 budget. We can discuss the scope in more detail to ensure we're prioritizing the most impactful features for your launch. I'm confident we can create a fantastic online store for your business. Let me know your thoughts!", "sender_id": 7, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:24:00.679887"}, {"message_id": 20, "content": "Hi Sarah, thanks for the update! It's great you're actively exploring options for your e-commerce website. I've reviewed the proposal you received and it sounds like a solid starting point.\n\nBuilding on our initial conversation and understanding your business goals, I'd like to present my proposal. I'm confident I can deliver a high-quality, custom-designed, mobile-responsive e-commerce website with all the essential features: robust product management, secure checkout, and seamless payment gateway integration.\n\nMy proposed rate is $90 per hour, and based on the scope we discussed, I estimate the project will take approximately 70-85 hours. This brings the total estimated cost to between $6,300 and $7,650. I'm particularly excited about delivering this for you within a 5-week timeline, ensuring a quick and effective launch for your online store.\n\nI believe this offers a strong balance of quality, speed, and value tailored to your needs. I'm eager to discuss this further and answer any questions you may have. Would you be open to a quick call later today or tomorrow to go over the details?", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:27:27.940347"}]}
