You receive some messages from them {"1": [{"message_id": 3, "content": "Hi Alex, I'm reaching out to discuss a potential partnership between our companies. I'm keen to explore how we can integrate your innovative feature into our platform and create mutual value. Would you be open to a brief call next week to discuss this further?", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:33.845463"}, {"message_id": 8, "content": "Hi Alex, I'm really impressed with your team's innovative feature and see a huge potential for synergy with our platform. I believe a partnership could bring significant value to both of us, expanding our user base and providing great exposure for your solution. I'd love to discuss how we can work together. Would you be open to a call sometime this week to explore a potential partnership? I was thinking a revenue share of 30% and clear attribution would be a good starting point for our discussion. Let me know what you think!", "sender_id": 1, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:11:46.297803"}, {"message_id": 13, "content": "Hi Alex, thanks for your message and your enthusiasm for a partnership. I appreciate you sharing your initial thoughts on the revenue share. I agree that a call would be the best way to explore this further and ensure we align on terms that are mutually beneficial. How about we schedule a call for sometime this week? During the call, we can dive deeper into the specifics of the integration, user base expansion, and how we can structure a revenue share that reflects the value both companies bring. Looking forward to it!", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:16:28.185663"}, {"message_id": 21, "content": "Hi Alex, following up on my previous message. I'm excited about the potential for a partnership and would love to schedule a call this week to discuss the integration, user growth, and a fair revenue share. Please let me know what time works best for you. I'm eager to hear your thoughts on how we can make this a success for both our companies!", "sender_id": 1, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:23:04.596783"}, {"message_id": 23, "content": "Hi Alex, I'm available for a call on Wednesday at 10 AM PST or Thursday at 2 PM PST. Please let me know which of these times works best for you, or if another time would be more convenient. I'm looking forward to our discussion!", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:24:15.131463"}]}
