You receive some messages from them {"5": [{"message_id": 1, "content": "Hi Alex, I'm the product manager from [Your Company Name]. I've been really impressed with your feature and see a lot of potential for a mutually beneficial partnership. I'd love to discuss how we can integrate your solution into our platform and explore a revenue-sharing model. Let me know when would be a good time to chat.", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:19.449483"}, {"message_id": 4, "content": "Hello Alex, I'm evaluating potential partnership opportunities and came across your innovative feature. I'm keen to explore how we might integrate it into our platform to create a win-win scenario. Would you be open to a brief discussion next week?", "sender_id": 8, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:10:33.961683"}, {"message_id": 12, "content": "Hi Alex, just wanted to gently follow up on my previous message regarding a potential partnership. Please let me know if you have any availability to connect in the coming days. Looking forward to hearing from you!", "sender_id": 8, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:16:06.612063"}, {"message_id": 18, "content": "Hi Alex, I understand you're busy, but I'm really excited about the potential here. Would you be free for a quick 15-minute call tomorrow at 10 AM [Your Time Zone]? We can discuss the revenue share and attribution in more detail. Let me know if that works or suggest another time.", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:23:02.431203"}, {"message_id": 19, "content": "Hi Alex, I understand you're likely very busy. To make things easier, would you be open to a quick 15-minute call this Wednesday or Thursday? We could discuss the potential integration and revenue share at a high level. Let me know what works best for you.", "sender_id": 8, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:23:02.447583"}]}
