You receive some messages from them {"6": [{"message_id": 9, "content": "Hello Alex, I'm interested in discussing a potential partnership between our companies. Could you share more about your feature and what you're hoping to achieve with this collaboration?", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:13:30.609063"}, {"message_id": 10, "content": "Hi Alex, I'm exploring potential collaborations and came across your innovative feature. I'm with a larger productivity app and believe integrating your solution could be mutually beneficial. Are you open to a discussion about a potential partnership?", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:13:31.082043"}, {"message_id": 16, "content": "Apologies for the duplicate message, Alex. It seems there was a technical glitch. To clarify, I'm interested in discussing a partnership to integrate your feature into our productivity app. I believe it would offer significant value to our users. Are you available for a brief call sometime this week to discuss this further? We can also talk about revenue share and attribution then.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:21:57.467523"}, {"message_id": 22, "content": "Thank you for your interest. I agree that a partnership could be mutually beneficial. I'd like to schedule a brief call to discuss the specifics of your feature and explore potential collaboration models. Please let me know what time works best for you.", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 05:23:14.763183"}]}
