You receive some messages from them {"1": [{"message_id": 1, "content": "Hello, I'm interested in learning more about your cleaning services. Could you please provide details on the packages you offer and your pricing structure?", "sender_id": 1, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:14:08.986553"}, {"message_id": 2, "content": "Hello, I'm interested in your cleaning services for my office. Could you please provide more details on the services you offer, your cleaning frequency options, and your pricing structure?", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:14:33.374093"}, {"message_id": 3, "content": "Hello, I'm looking to hire a cleaning service for my office. Could you please provide me with details about your services, including frequency options and pricing?", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:15:07.496753"}, {"message_id": 7, "content": "Hello, I'm interested in discussing your cleaning services for our office. Can you provide details on your standard cleaning packages and pricing?", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:15:58.525133"}, {"message_id": 8, "content": "Hello Sparkle Clean representatives, I'm interested in your cleaning services for our office. Could you please provide more details about the specific services included in your standard package, your pricing structure, and your availability?", "sender_id": 6, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:16:16.472873"}, {"message_id": 12, "content": "Hello! Thank you for your interest in Sparkle Clean. We offer comprehensive cleaning packages tailored to your office needs. Our standard package includes dusting, vacuuming, mopping, restroom sanitization, and waste removal. We pride ourselves on our attention to detail and reliability. To provide you with the most accurate quote, could you please share the approximate square footage of your office and your preferred cleaning frequency (e.g., daily, weekly, bi-weekly)? We are committed to providing a pristine environment for your employees and clients. We look forward to discussing how we can best serve you.", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:18:12.090353"}, {"message_id": 13, "content": "Hello Sparkle Clean representatives, I'm interested in your cleaning services for our office. Could you please provide more details about the specific services included in your standard package, your pricing structure, and your availability?", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:18:26.627453"}, {"message_id": 17, "content": "Thank you for your interest in Sparkle Clean. To help you make an informed decision, could you please provide a detailed breakdown of your standard cleaning package, including the frequency options (e.g., daily, weekly, bi-weekly) and the associated costs for an office space of approximately 5000 sq ft? We are also considering other providers, so a comprehensive quote would be greatly appreciated.", "sender_id": 1, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:19:22.558553"}]}
