You receive some messages from them {"2": [{"message_id": 4, "content": "Hello, I'm interested in discussing cleaning services for our office. Could you please provide more details about your services and pricing?", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:15:07.564733"}, {"message_id": 5, "content": "Hello Eco Shine, I'm interested in learning more about your cleaning services. Could you please provide details on your standard cleaning package, including frequency options and pricing?", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:15:24.571913"}, {"message_id": 6, "content": "Hello Eco Shine Cleaning Representatives, I'm the office manager for a medium-sized company and I'm interested in learning more about your cleaning services for our office space. Could you please provide details on your service packages, pricing, and availability?", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:15:47.701253"}, {"message_id": 9, "content": "Hello! This is Ben from Eco-Shine. We're very interested in providing our eco-friendly and budget-conscious cleaning services for your office. I'd love to discuss your specific needs and how we can tailor a package for you. Are you available for a brief call sometime this week?", "sender_id": 7, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:16:20.057093"}, {"message_id": 10, "content": "Hi Ben, thank you for your prompt response. I'm available for a call tomorrow at 10 AM or 2 PM. Please let me know which time works best for you. I'm eager to learn more about Eco-Shine's services and discuss how we can partner.", "sender_id": 9, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:18:02.026673"}, {"message_id": 11, "content": "Hi Ben, thank you for reaching out. I'm interested in learning more about Eco-Shine's services. Could you please provide details on your standard cleaning package, including frequency options and pricing? I'd also like to know about your availability.", "sender_id": 13, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:18:05.788253"}, {"message_id": 14, "content": "Hello Ben, thank you for reaching out. I'm available for a call to discuss our office cleaning needs. Please let me know what time works best for you this week.", "sender_id": 11, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:18:32.994893"}, {"message_id": 15, "content": "Hello Ben, thank you for your prompt response. I'm available for a call to discuss our office cleaning needs. Please let me know what time works best for you this week.", "sender_id": 10, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:18:33.592433"}, {"message_id": 16, "content": "Thank you all for your interest in Eco-Shine! We offer comprehensive cleaning services with a focus on eco-friendly products and competitive pricing. Our standard package includes (mention a few key services, e.g., dusting, vacuuming, surface cleaning, restroom sanitization). We offer flexible scheduling, with options for daily, weekly, or bi-weekly services. To provide you with accurate pricing and a tailored package, I'd love to schedule a brief call to understand your specific office needs. Please let me know what time works best for you this week.", "sender_id": 7, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:18:57.528533"}, {"message_id": 18, "content": "Hi Ben, thank you for reaching out. I'm the office manager looking to hire a cleaning service. I'm very interested in Eco-Shine's services, especially your eco-friendly approach. Could you please provide more details on your standard cleaning package, including frequency options and pricing? I'd also like to understand your availability for a medium-sized office space.", "sender_id": 12, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 06:20:22.040573"}]}
